{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditiveWrithe","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditiveWrithe","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.List.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Module.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fin.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Abel","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.crossingEnergy_eq_writhe_add_length","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.crossingEnergy_eq_writhe_add_length","kind":"theorem","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L177-L189","doc":"The crossing energy splits into a writhe part and a length part:\n`E = w · (q + q⁻¹)/2 + ℓ · (q − q⁻¹)/2` (char ≠ 2). With `q = e^λ` this is\n`w cosh λ + ℓ sinh λ`. Only the first summand is a braid function. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.crossingEnergy_not_cancellation_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.crossingEnergy_not_cancellation_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L169-L175","doc":"Contrapositive form: for `q ≠ 0` with `q² ≠ 1` the crossing energy is not\ninvariant under free cancellation, so it is a function of the word, not of the\nbraid. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.sq_eq_one_of_crossingEnergy_cancellation_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.sq_eq_one_of_crossingEnergy_cancellation_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L155-L167","doc":"**The crossing energy is not a braid function away from `q² = 1`.**\nIf it is invariant under free cancellation, then `q² = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.crossingEnergy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.crossingEnergy","kind":"def","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L150-L153","doc":"The crossing energy `E = q·n₊ − q⁻¹·n₋` of `def:crossing-energy`, as a\ncrossing-additive functional: weight `q` on `σᵢ`, weight `−q⁻¹` on `σᵢ⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.writhe_smul_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.writhe_smul_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L133-L142","doc":"Conversely, every multiple of the writhe is invariant under both moves. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.energy_eq_writhe_smul_of_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.energy_eq_writhe_smul_of_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L125-L131","doc":"**Exclusion theorem.** A crossing-additive functional that is invariant\nunder free cancellation and the braid relation is a multiple of the writhe. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.energy_eq_writhe_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.energy_eq_writhe_smul","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L115-L123","doc":"If every positive weight is `c` and every negative weight is `−c`, the\nfunctional is `writhe • c`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.weight_eq_zero_index","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.weight_eq_zero_index","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L104-L113","doc":"All positive weights equal the weight of `σ₀` when the braid relation holds. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.weight_eq_of_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.weight_eq_of_braid","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L94-L102","doc":"The braid relation forces adjacent positive weights to agree. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.neg_weight_of_cancellation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.neg_weight_of_cancellation","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L87-L92","doc":"Free cancellation forces the negative weight to be minus the positive one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.BraidInvariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.BraidInvariant","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L80-L85","doc":"Invariance under the braid relation for adjacent generators, in every\ncontext: `u σᵢσⱼσᵢ v` and `u σⱼσᵢσⱼ v` have the same value when `j = i + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.CancellationInvariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.CancellationInvariant","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L74-L78","doc":"Invariance under free cancellation, in every context:\n`u σᵢ^ε σᵢ^{−ε} v` and `u v` have the same value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.writhe_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.writhe_cons","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L70-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.writhe_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.writhe_nil","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L68-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.energy_append","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.energy_append","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L64-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.energy_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.energy_cons","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L60-L62","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.energy_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.energy_nil","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.writhe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.writhe","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L54-L56","doc":"The writhe: number of positive letters minus number of negative letters. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.energy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.energy","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L49-L52","doc":"The crossing-additive functional with weights `a` on positive letters and\n`b` on negative letters. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.Letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingAdditive.Letter","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/CrossingAdditiveWrithe.lean#L42-L43","doc":"A braid letter: generator index and sign (`true` = positive crossing). ","signatureChunk":0}]}